Input: {"correlation_id": "ETH-USDT-1h-1789988399999", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789993800000, "account": {"equity": "9983.069133506757", "available_margin": "9795.367743506756800000000000", "currency": "USDT", "position_mode": "HEDGE", "as_of_ms": 1789993800000}, "position": {"position_id": "wf-main-4", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "quantity": "0.345", "mark_price": "2720.31", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1789993800000, "entry_price": "2717.2717", "unrealized_pnl": "1.0482135"}, "positions": [{"position_id": "wf-main-4", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "quantity": "0.345", "mark_price": "2720.31", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1789993800000, "entry_price": "2717.2717", "unrealized_pnl": "1.0482135"}], "executor_state": {"as_of_ms": 1789993800000, "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "fills_read_status": "available", "executors": [{"executor_id": "wf-exec-7", "status": "RUNNING", "trading_pair": "ETH-USDT", "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "position_id": "wf-main-4", "config": {"stop_price": "2702.560000000000000000000000", "target_price": "2745.880000000000000000000001"}}]}, "open_orders": [], "recent_fills": [{"fill_id": "wf-fill-7", "order_id": "wf-fill-7", "position_id": "wf-main-4", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "status": "FILLED", "quantity": "0.345", "price": "2717.2717", "fee": "0.37498349460", "filled_at_ms": 1789988699999}], "fills_since_last_event": [], "original_trade_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789988399999, "market_context": {"D1": {"regime": "bull-trend breakout", "freshness": "current", "note": "First three consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling (2612.02/2632.98/2642.90) with rising swing lows 2357.18 -> 2358.62 -> 2413.82 -> 2436.87; always-in long."}, "H4": {"regime": "bull channel pressing the 2700.00 range top", "freshness": "current", "note": "Higher lows 2370.54/2436.87/2495.82/2608.83/2568.16; two exact 2700.00 highs (1789804800000, 1789948800000) marked the top, and the M15/H1 spike to 2850.00 has now overshot that level and fallen back to test it."}, "H1": {"note": "Strong bull leg 2568.16 -> 2850.00; last H1 bar (open_time 1789984800000) O 2720.66 H 2721.47 L 2709.56 C 2715.68 is a small inside hesitation bar after the climax H1 bar (open_time 1789981200000, O 2696.51 H 2850.00 L 2694.94 C 2720.66)."}, "M15": {"note": "Climactic spike bar 114 (O 2708.33 H 2850.00 L 2702.56 C 2739.13), then a five-bar tight flag (bars 115-119) holding above the 2700.00 breakout level."}}, "setup": {"type": "bull flag / breakout-pullback long: buy stop above the flag's last bar high with structural stop below the spike bar low", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["M15", "H1", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high (last closed bar of the flag; small bull bar closing 2715.68 in the top quarter of its 2709.56-2716.56 range)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2716.56", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1789987500000, "close_time_ms": 1789988399999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 114 low (spike bar low, sitting just above the 2700.00 H4/D1 breakout level; a trade below it breaks the pullback low and the whole breakout-pullback)", "price_field": "low", "price": "2702.56", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 114, "open_time_ms": 1789983000000, "close_time_ms": 1789983899999}}, "evidence_for": ["D1 context (current) is a bull-trend breakout: closes 2612.02/2632.98/2642.90 are the first three above the 2557.46 range ceiling, swing lows rise 2357.18 -> 2358.62 -> 2413.82 -> 2436.87, and the M15/H1 rally has now exceeded the D1 spike high 2771 (M15 bar 114 high 2850.00).", "H4 context (current) is an always-in-long bull channel off 2358.62 with higher lows 2370.54, 2436.87, 2495.82, 2608.83, 2568.16; the pullback is holding just above its 2700.00 range top.", "H1 raw bar open_time 1789984800000 (O 2720.66 H 2721.47 L 2709.56 C 2715.68) is an inside hesitation bar, not a bear reversal bar; there is no H1 close below 2694.94, the low of H1 bar open_time 1789981200000, so the H1 trend structure is intact.", "M15 bar 114 (open 2708.33, high 2850.00, low 2702.56, close 2739.13) cleared the 2700.00 range top and the D1 spike high 2771; bars 115-119 then hold above it (lows 2717.36, 2716.28, 2711.92, 2709.60, 2709.56), i.e. a pullback that is holding the breakout zone rather than failing back into the range.", "M15 bars 118 and 119 print an equal-low micro double bottom (2709.60 and 2709.56) with higher closes (2714.49 then 2715.68), and bar 119 closes 2715.68 near its 2716.56 high - a small bull signal bar at the low of the flag.", "Location and trader's equation: stop entry above 2716.56 with invalidation at 2702.56 is about 14.0 points of risk against about 22.6 points to the 2739.13 flag high / spike close, with 2776.28 and 2850.00 beyond, while H1, H4 and D1 are all always-in long."], "evidence_against": ["M15 bar 114 is climactic: range 147.44 points with a 110.87-point upper tail (high 2850.00 versus close 2739.13), far larger than the preceding ~10-point bars, which typically starts a trading range rather than immediate continuation.", "The H1 bar covering 1789981200000-1789984799999 (O 2696.51 H 2850.00 L 2694.94 C 2720.66) closed in the bottom quarter of its range - a climax/possible reversal bar on H1, and the next H1 bar closed lower at 2715.68.", "The pullback has already given back most of the last leg: from the 2850.00 high to the 2709.56 low (bar 119) is about 69% of the 2646.02 -> 2850.00 leg (M15 bar 107 low to bar 114 high), and price at 2715.68 is back in the lower third of the spike bar, below its midpoint 2776.28, with resistance at 2739.13 and 2776.28 before 2850.00.", "Bars 116-119 are a tight, overlapping base (bodies 0.41, 9.15, 2.57 and 1.18 points versus 30.80 on bar 114), so the signal bar is weak; a slip below 2709.56 would put 2700.00/2694.94 back in play before the long can work.", "The H4 read had already flagged 2700.00 as a rejected top (two exact 2700.00 highs), so the 2850.00 spike can also be read as an overshoot/failed breakout now being sold back toward the range ceiling."], "qualitative_confidence": "low", "uncertainty": ["The 2850.00 print is an outlier (147-point bar after a sequence of roughly 4-15 point bars); whether it is genuine liquidity or a data/liquidity artefact cannot be resolved from the supplied bars, and raw bars are treated as authoritative either way.", "Whether the post-climax correction still needs a second leg toward 2700.00/2694.94 before the bull resumes; the five-bar flag is unresolved at the decision time and the pending stop is not yet triggered.", "Signal-bar quality is weak in a tight range after a climax; missing volume, order-flow or indicator data is not treated as a veto or as a reason to abstain."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["A close below 2702.56 (M15 bar 114 low) would break the flag and the breakout-pullback; an additional break of 2694.94 would confirm a failed breakout above 2700.00 and shift the read back to trading range.", "Acceptance above 2739.13 (flag high and spike close) with the following bar holding above it would confirm continuation toward 2776.28 and 2850.00.", "Repeated overlapping closes between 2709.56 and 2739.13 without breaking either edge would mark a new higher trading range and remove the long's edge."]}, "latest_trader_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789991999999, "market_context": {"H1": "Bull trend / breakout above 2700.00. Last H1 bar (open_time_ms 1789988400000, open 2715.68, high 2727.03, low 2713.04, close 2723.15) is a bull bar closing in its top quarter and holding above the broken level; the prior H1 bar (1789981200000) opened 2696.51, spiked to 2850.00 and closed 2720.66.", "M15": "Strong bull leg off 2568.16, then a tight 8-bar range 2709.56-2727.03 (bars 112-119) sitting above the former 2700.00 upper extreme - a bull flag at the highs whose top was just probed by bar 119.", "H4": "Supplied H4 context stale; 120 closed raw H4 bars read successfully to 1789991999999. Last H4 bar (1789977600000, open 2658.81, high 2850.00, low 2658.06, close 2723.15) is the highest close of the window, with the 2700.00 range top now exceeded on a closing basis.", "D1": "Context current: breakout-spike above the 2557.46 range ceiling; price has since extended to new highs above the 2700 area."}, "setup": {"type": "Tight-range (bull flag) breakout above a multi-day range top in a bull trend - continuation stop entry", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "continuation", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar index 119 (open_time_ms 1789991100000) high 2727.03, the top of the 8-bar tight range and of the bull flag above 2700.00", "price_field": "high", "price": "2727.03", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1789991100000, "close_time_ms": 1789991999999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar index 115 (open_time_ms 1789987500000) low 2709.56, the base of the tight range and the most recent higher low above the broken 2700.00 level", "price_field": "low", "price": "2709.56", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 115, "open_time_ms": 1789987500000, "close_time_ms": 1789988399999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 119 (open_time_ms 1789991100000, open 2726.12, high 2727.03, low 2720.05, close 2723.15) makes a marginal new high above bar 118 (high 2727.01, close 2726.12) and holds in the upper half of its range, so the flag top is already being probed upward.", "M15 bars 112-119 form a tight 8-bar range 2709.56-2727.03 whose floor (bar 115 low 2709.56) sits above the broken 2700.00 former range extreme - the classic bull-flag position just after an upside breakout.", "Pullbacks are being bought: M15 higher lows 2616.09 (bar 60 low, 1789938000000), 2646.02 (bar 103 low, 1789976700000), 2658.06 (bar 104 low, 1789977600000), 2709.56 (bar 115 low, 1789987500000).", "Momentum with follow-through is present: M15 bar 106 (1789979400000, open 2677.82) drives to high 2706.86 and closes 2699.99; H1 bar 1789977600000 runs 2658.81 to 2696.51 and the next H1 bar closes 2720.66.", "Raw H4 read (120 closed bars to 1789991999999) ends at the window's highest close (2723.15) above the 2700.00 range top, and current D1 reads breakout-spike above the 2557.46 ceiling - higher timeframes lean the same way as the raw M15 flag."], "evidence_against": ["Strongest opposing case: M15 bar 110 (open_time_ms 1789983000000, open 2708.33, high 2850.00, low 2702.56, close 2739.13) left about a 110.87-point upper tail, so a resting seller sits above; price is still roughly 123 points below that print and the tight range could be a climactic pause rather than a bull flag.", "The leg from the 2568.16 low (M15 bar 22 low, 1789902900000) to 2727.03 is about 159 points with no H1 pullback, so a stop entry at a new high is late in the leg and far from support other than the 2700.00 breakout level.", "This region has repeatedly rejected price: raw H4 shows 2680.00 (bar 1789128000000, close 2555.52) and 2700.00 (bar 1789804800000, high 2700.00, close 2638.49, 61.5 upper tail) both failing, each followed by roughly 250-point declines.", "M15 bar 111 (open 2739.13, high 2739.13, low 2717.36, close 2720.66) is a bear bar immediately after the spike, and no closed M15 bar has yet closed above 2727.03, so the flag breakout is untriggered."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["The 2850.00 print on M15 bar 110 is not corroborated by any other individual supplied bar; whether it is a genuine traded level or a data artifact is unknown.", "The trigger 2727.03 is untriggered, so the flag's resolution is unresolved at the decision time.", "Whether 2709.56-2727.03 is a bull flag (continuation) or the first pause before a deeper pullback to the 2700.00 breakout level cannot be settled from closed bars alone."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["Failure: an M15 close below 2709.56 followed by a close below 2700.00 would mark the breakout as failed and return the read to the 2358.62-2700.00 H4 range.", "Continuation: an M15 close above 2727.03 that holds above 2700.00 confirms the flag breakout and keeps focus on the 2850.00 spike high.", "Deeper damage: a close below 2656.75 (M15 bar 101 low, 1789974900000) would end the sequence of higher lows and put the bull leg in doubt."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789948799999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["Window opens at 2116.86 and falls to 1368.42 (bar 13 low, close 1568.55), then reverses; final close 2642.90 is about +24.9% versus the first open and about +93% above the window low.", "Bars 87-89 are the spike: 1916.51 to 2252.16, 2252.20 to 2326.32, 2326.31 to 2515.30, with the window high 2771 printed on bar 89.", "Bars 90-116 are two-sided: overlapping bodies, highs at 2557.46 (bar 95) and 2609.02 (bar 113), lows clustered 2357.18-2425.44; bar 110 spiked to 2680 and closed 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 \u2014 the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling; bar 117 has open 2446.22, high 2643.52, low 2436.87, range 206.65, closing in its top quarter; bar 118 reaches 2700.", "Bar 119 (open 2632.98, high 2645.88, low 2568.16, close 2642.90) is a 77.72-range bar closing near its high while holding above the range ceiling; it makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700).", "Recent lows rise: 2357.18 (bar 101), 2358.62 (bar 114), 2370.54 (bar 115), 2413.82 (bar 116), 2436.87 (bar 117), 2568.16 (bar 119).", "Price 2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the post-spike section is not yet a confirmed new-high trend."], "evidence_against": ["The breakout is only three bars; the preceding 27 bars overlap heavily and the region 2357-2557 can still be read as the operating trading range rather than broken.", "Two earlier upside probes failed to hold: bar 110 high 2680 closed 2514.72, bar 113 high 2609.02 closed 2514.07, so upside spikes in this region have recently been rejected.", "2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the whole post-spike section can be read as one broad trading range whose upper extreme has not been exceeded.", "Bar 119 makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700) with a lower tail to 2568.16, a pause rather than a strong continuation bar, and bar 114 had just traded down to 2358.62 four bars before the breakout."], "uncertainty": ["V2 D1 context adapted for the V1 PM input."]}, "management_history": [{"schema": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "role": "POSITION_MANAGER", "decision_time_ms": 1789988760142, "action": "HOLD", "position_ids": ["wf-main-4"], "reason": "The single MAIN long is coherent with its fill and executor state, margin is SAFE, no hedge leg exists, and the documented breakout-pullback premise is still holding: the five M15 bars after the spike (lows 2717.36/2716.28/2711.92/2709.60/2709.56) all close above the 2702.56 structural invalidation, and mark 2718.13 is above entry 2717.2717. The policy does not mandate a strategy stop, so the empty protective order list is not by itself an unmet risk condition.", "evidence": {"observations": ["Position wf-main-4 is ETH-USDT LONG 0.345, entry 2717.2717, mark 2718.13, unrealized +0.296, ownership_role MAIN, matching the fil